---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Is YumEarth Healthy? The Honest Answer"
  description="YumEarth is candy — not a health food. But compared to conventional candy, the difference in ingredients is significant. Here's an honest breakdown."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": "Is YumEarth Healthy? The Honest Answer",
    "description": "YumEarth is candy — not a health food. But compared to conventional candy, the ingredient difference is significant.",
    "image": "https://yumearth.eu/images/og-default.jpg",
    "datePublished": "2025-01-01T00:00:00+00:00",
    "author": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "YumEarth EU", "url": "https://yumearth.eu" },
    "publisher": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "YumEarth EU", "url": "https://yumearth.eu", "logo": { "@type": "ImageObject", "url": "https://yumearth.eu/images/yumearth-logo.png" } },
    "mainEntityOfPage": { "@type": "WebPage", "@id": "https://yumearth.eu/blog/is-yumearth-healthy" }
  })} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Is YumEarth healthy?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "YumEarth is candy and contains sugar. It is not a health food. However, it contains no artificial dyes, no artificial flavors, no high-fructose corn syrup, and is USDA Organic certified — making it a significantly cleaner option than conventional candy." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Does YumEarth have artificial colors?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "No. YumEarth uses organic fruit and vegetable juice concentrates for color — no FD&C synthetic dyes like Red 40 or Yellow 5." } },
      { "@type": "Question", "name": "Is YumEarth USDA Organic?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. YumEarth is USDA Organic certified, meaning ingredients were grown without synthetic pesticides or fertilizers and are non-GMO." } }
    ]
  })} />
  <Nav />
  <main class="pt-32 pb-24">
    <article class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
        <a href="/blog" class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest" style="color:var(--color-teal);">← Blog</a>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-full" style="background:rgba(0,122,133,0.10); color:var(--color-teal);">Nutrition</span>
        <span class="text-xs" style="color:var(--color-ink-muted);">2025</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-black mb-6" style="font-family:'ClashDisplay','Nunito',sans-serif; font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,3rem); line-height:1.0; letter-spacing:-0.03em;">
        Is YumEarth Healthy? The Honest Answer.
      </h1>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-base" style="color:var(--color-ink); line-height:1.75;">
        <p class="text-xl font-medium" style="color:var(--color-ink-muted); line-height:1.65; max-width:65ch;">It's candy. It contains sugar. It is not a health food. But compared to what's in most conventional candy, the ingredient difference is real and significant.</p>
        <h2 class="font-black text-xl mt-10 mb-2" style="font-family:'ClashDisplay','Nunito',sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.02em;">What YumEarth doesn't contain</h2>
        <p style="max-width:65ch;">No FD&C synthetic dyes (Red 40, Yellow 5, Blue 1, etc.). No high-fructose corn syrup. No artificial flavors. No preservatives. No top 9 allergens. No gelatin. These aren't minor omissions — they're the things parents and health-conscious shoppers specifically look to avoid.</p>
        <h2 class="font-black text-xl mt-10 mb-2" style="font-family:'ClashDisplay','Nunito',sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.02em;">What it does contain</h2>
        <p style="max-width:65ch;">Organic cane sugar. Organic brown rice syrup. Organic fruit and vegetable juice concentrates for color. Natural flavors from fruit extracts. Vitamin C in some products. The ingredient list is short and readable — every item is something you'd recognize.</p>
        <h2 class="font-black text-xl mt-10 mb-2" style="font-family:'ClashDisplay','Nunito',sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.02em;">USDA Organic certification</h2>
        <p style="max-width:65ch;">USDA Organic means the ingredients were grown without synthetic pesticides or fertilizers and are non-GMO. It doesn't mean low-sugar or nutritionally dense — but it does mean what's in the product meets a strict standard for how it was grown and processed.</p>
        <h2 class="font-black text-xl mt-10 mb-2" style="font-family:'ClashDisplay','Nunito',sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.02em;">The real comparison</h2>
        <p style="max-width:65ch;">Compare YumEarth to other candy, not to an apple. On that comparison, it wins clearly: real color sources, real flavor sources, no synthetic additives, certified organic. For a family that wants to occasionally give their kids candy without the chemical load, YumEarth is one of the better options available.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-16 rounded-3xl p-10" style="background:var(--color-surface);">
        <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-3" style="color:var(--color-teal);">Real ingredients</p>
        <h3 class="font-black mb-3" style="font-family:'ClashDisplay','Nunito',sans-serif; font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem); letter-spacing:-0.03em;">Candy you can read the label on.</h3>
        <p class="text-base mb-6" style="color:var(--color-ink-muted); line-height:1.65; max-width:480px;">No artificial dyes. No artificial flavors. USDA Organic certified. Available wholesale across Europe & the Middle East.</p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/products" class="btn-primary text-sm">View products →</a>
          <a href="/contact" class="btn-secondary text-sm">Get in touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
